@startuml
title {{REQ_ID}} {{REQ_NAME}} - 主要互動循序圖

actor "使用者" as User
participant "前端介面" as Client
participant "後端 API 服務" as API
database "資料庫" as DB

User -> Client : 操作與送出請求
Client -> API : POST /api/v1/resource
API -> DB : 寫入 / 查詢資料
DB --> API : 回傳結果
API --> Client : 200 OK (JSON Payload)
Client --> User : 顯示操作結果
@enduml
